  message: "Fixed in PR #1846. Root cause: format_tiered_behavior_map received unfiltered all_symbols including boundary nodes. When no high-confidence entrypoints existed, boundary nodes dominated connectivity selection. Fix adds external_boundary check to eligible_symbols filter."  # 1baf
